In the mines the general principle is to take a few whacks and
escape up the stairs as soon as you start taking hits, plus
throwing some missiles or zapping some wands to clear the
level out.  That standard approach is insufficient for monsters
powerfull enough and an MMF is one of those problem
monsters.

You need something powerfull enough that single blasts will
clear the crowd and you'll be able to take out the MMF from a
distance.  Rocks do *not* come to mind for this purpose.  A
wand of lightning does, and Mjollnir wielded plus gloves of
power to be able to throw it again and again does as well.
Until then come back when your helmet is at least greased or
your AC is negative and you have something very powerfull
for offense.  At least a pair of fire/cold wands.

> Should she even be *in* the mines?

Definitely.  If you survived to arrive in mines end you're doing
fine.  Go back for a while.  Maybe do Sokoban, maybe do
some altar camping then come back later.

